r=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/r_line.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이전 \n                                        패키지인 르네상스,블랙손의복수.AOS등을 구입하지 \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">않으셔도 <b>ML \n                            패키지(</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">ULTIMA \n                            ONLINE MONDAIN'S LEGACY)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"> <font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하나만 구입하시면 모든 \n                                        것을 즐기실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#333333\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"baseline\" border=\"0\" src=\"/img/posts/site/UObox_1.gif\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>ULTIMA \n                                        ONLINE MONDAIN'S LEGACY</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><span class=\"highlight\" style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b>시스템 최소 사양:</b></font></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br>ULTIMA \n                                        ONLINE MONDAIN'S LEGACY SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">OS: \n                                        Windows XP or 98SE </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Internet: \n                                        56.6 Kbps or faster Internet connection \n                                        is required</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">CPU: \n                                        400 MHz or faster for 2D version (500 \n                                        MHz for 3D version)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">RAM: \n                                        128 MB or more </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Disc \n                                        Drive: 4x or faster CD/DVD drive</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Hard \n                                        Drive: 1.1 GB or more free space</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Video: \n                                        DirectX 9.0 compatible 8 MB video card \n                                        for 2D version (32 MB Direct3D capable \n                                        for 3D version)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Sound: \n                                        DirectX 9.0 compatible</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마 온라인: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">최신 \n                                        버전인 몬데인레가시(MONDAIN'S LEGACY)를 구입하시면 \n                                        2D/3D를 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">선택해서 플레이 하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시디를 \n                                        구입하시고 계정등록을 하시는 방법은 \n                                        시디 매뉴얼을 참조하시고 \n                                        본홈 좌측메뉴의 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">초보자지침서를 이용하시길 \n                                        바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">울티마온라인의 \n                                        한달이용료는11,000으로 타 \n                                        게임보다도 훨씬 저렴합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또한 \n                                        이번 SE는 가격대 만족도가 \n                                        상당히 높으므로 아직 \n                                        울온을 경험해 보지 못한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">플레이어들에게는 \n                                        좋은 \n                                        기회입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구입처 \n                                        : <b><a href=\"https://www.uogamecodes.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.uogamecodes.com</a></b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:20;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><a href=\"http://www.kr.uo.com\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\">ORIGIN</font></span></b></a></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n",
